["note","HKREFACT-T13",1780053637,"codex-worker",{"msg":"Dogfood findings (2026-05-29): (1) Installed arm binary may lag source and hide new flags; users need explicit guidance to run rebuilt binary. (2) network plan prints payload classes but not endpoint family details per command path; consider adding endpoint host hints. (3) devin remediation suggests  even when binary is absent; preflight should detect missing binary and print install-first remediation. (4) show-network-plan writes to stderr; JSON-only tooling may miss disclosure unless stderr captured."}]
["note","HKREFACT-T13",1780053644,"codex-worker",{"msg":"Dogfood findings (2026-05-29): (1) Installed arm binary may lag source and hide new flags; users need explicit guidance to run rebuilt binary. (2) network plan prints payload classes but not endpoint family details per command path; consider adding endpoint host hints. (3) devin remediation should detect missing binary and print install-first guidance before auth guidance. (4) show-network-plan currently writes to stderr; JSON-only tooling may miss disclosure unless stderr is captured."}]
